OL,3,GNEWSA'Children's postcode does not
OL,4,Adefine their future'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's ranking as the hardest place
OL,7,Fto grow up in England does not define
OL,8,Fits children's future, a teacher has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FA report published by the Children's
OL,12,FCommissioner about growing up in the UK
OL,13,Fsaid the lives of too many children
OL,14,Fwere now "Dickensian with a modern
OL,15,Ftwist", citing drugs and social media
OL,16,Fas two main areas where young people
OL,17,Fwere exploited.
OL,19,FMiddlesbrough came top of the list in
OL,20,Fthe Childhood Lottery report, which
OL,21,Fanalysed metrics such as health and
OL,22,Fsocial care, education and safety.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
