OL,3,GNEWSA'Children's postcode does not
OL,4,Adefine their future'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut deputy principal for curriculum and
OL,7,Fstudents at Middlesbrough College,
OL,8,FAimey Adamson, said the report was not
OL,9,Fabout "their talent, their ambition or
OL,10,Ftheir potential".
